Experience gained in the military may be used toward
the requirements for licensure. Please complete the <a href="https://www2.myfloridalicense.com/pro/documents/MVL002_Military-Veteran_Fee_Waiver_and_Military_Service_Verification.pdf">Veteran Fee Waiver and
